# Pages

- Shell is `src/components/Base.astro`.
- Routes: `/`, `/about`, `/weddings`, `/lookbook`, `/lookbook/[slug]`, `/journal`, `/journal/[slug]`, `/partner`, `/newsletter`, `404`.
- New pages need an entry in the header menus or footer, and a screenshot refresh (`npm run screenshots`).
